  "description": "Since being marked as a saint at the tender age of 8, Gloria has been slaying demons and healing soldiers on the battlefield. That is, until one day, the Empire decides to cast her aside in favor of a new, more docile saint by framing her as a fake. Quick to switch to solution mode, Gloria assembles a motley crew and sets up a plan to take revenge on those who wronged her. With her hunky acolytes and her trusted mace in hand, can she restore her honor and make the damned rascals pay? \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
